# Real secret file for the discord_config `webhook_url_file` in alertmanager.yml.
#
# 1. Discord: channel -> Edit Channel -> Integrations -> Webhooks -> New Webhook
# 2. Copy the Webhook URL
# 3. cp discord_webhook_url.example discord_webhook_url   (drop the .example)
# 4. Replace the line below with the real URL - nothing else in the file
#
# `discord_webhook_url` (no .example) is gitignored - this repo is PUBLIC, a
# committed webhook URL would let anyone post into your Discord channel.
# Deploying to a server: copy this file there out-of-band (scp/rsync) - it
# intentionally does NOT travel via `git push`.
https://discord.com/api/webhooks/REPLACE_ME/REPLACE_ME
